  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Responsive Economic Empowerment project in Nepal (GREEN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to climate justice, resilient livelihood, income, food security and women leadership development of farmers and seasonal migrant worker&apos;s families of Nepal.  The final beneficiaries are families of Nepali migrant workers to India in order to bring desired changes in lives and livelihoods of the migrant worker&apos;s families, the project will work with the following target groups, cooperatives.  Women Empowerment Centres (WEC) , local municipalities, district authorities and provincial government.</narrative>
  </description>
